X:1
T:Hark, the Voice of Jesus Calling
T:GALILEAN
C:Music: Joseph Barnby, 1883 · Words: Daniel March, 1868
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "In Excelsis: hymns with tunes for Christian worship" By Century Company, 1911 copyright 1896 Hymn 462. This tune might come from "Original Tunes to Popular Hym. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/galilean_barnby): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
